      ],
      "claim_quote": "PMID 32972288 C-005 C-006 C-007 C-008 C-009 005 006 007 008 009 2020 1200000 1.200.000 27 30 600000 600.000 3 4 21 28 5 10 40 Benzathine penicillin G 1,200,000 units for >= 27 kg and 600,000 units for < 27 kg. Every 3 to 4 weeks (every 21 to 28 days). Without carditis: 5 years or until 21 years. Carditis without residual disease: 10 years or until 21 years. Persistent valvular disease: 10 years or until 40 years or lifelong.",
