        "thấp tim",
        "epidemiology",
        "pathogenesis"
      ],
      "claim_quote": "PMID 27188830 2016 Acute rheumatic fever is caused by Streptococcus pyogenes pharyngitis leading to rheumatic heart disease, the most common acquired heart disease in children.",
